<title>USA: AIM Management names Graham chief executive.</title>
<headline>AIM Management names Graham chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AIM Management Group Inc said it named Robert Graham chief executive.</p>
<p>AIM said Graham succeeds Charles Bauer, who will remain as chairman of the mutual fund company.  Graham, a co-founder of the company, was elected a director of AIM in 1993.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
